        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d57ab41e-de92-439f-998b-c47a9a747792\",\"review_text\":\"It gives a lot of adds...!....\"},{\"review_id\":\"67bd3859-f14d-4048-84bf-33869d7e4248\",\"review_text\":\"Thank u\"},{\"review_id\":\"6432b70d-3348-4601-bd6e-dcfd8248b93b\",\"review_text\":\"I am in love with Spotify but the issue is that I can't delete podcasts from \\\"your shows\\\" because there is a show that I didn't listen too but appeared on my shows and many people have this issue.\"},{\"review_id\":\"505f3ed1-4c47-4c0f-937b-a6eb566fd373\",\"review_text\":\"I hate how when you make a playlist they add songs that they think you like. If I wanted your stupid songs on my playlist I would add them but nooooo you add your stupid af songs to my legendary playlist and then after an hour of listening to my legendary playlist I will hear some stupid do song playing and I will go \\\"who is this shrimp di** singer and ther f****** stupid song\\\" and I will delete it but they keep coming back!!!!! So you get 2 stars stupid Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"f4588016-2a2a-4e8f-b80e-8db997f3864a\",\"review_text\":\"Been good up til last 6mos or so. App keeps stopping mid play. I have to constantly go into app and hit play, then when it starts again it's usually about a min back, so I hv to fast forward or listen to it again\"},{\"review_id\":\"98c6a057-b91e-47a6-a8c5-30f892b850f1\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9ce1510e-33a3-46fb-b08f-fc2fa2dff1c3\",\"review_text\":\"ANTHONY JOSEPH PAUL DIAZJR video.\"},{\"review_id\":\"35d29bf4-042a-4377-a58e-dd22458b40ef\",\"review_text\":\"Nice i enjoyed music best music app Easy to used..\"},{\"review_id\":\"89d17a00-229d-4deb-a854-d1e0aa05bb50\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application 👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"fe1f05ca-c231-4a0c-9576-fa71abd43e2c\",\"review_text\":\"It's just perfect for me. I wish they'd add audio books section as well to make it the ultimate listening app\"}]}"
